        "sustainability_heading": "Sustainable design",
        "sustainability_text": "<p>Sustainability is at the heart of our mission. We aim to minimize waste in every aspect of our production.</p><p>Understanding the environmental impact of single-use packaging, we've designed our packaging to be more than just a disposable shell but an essential and attractive part of the product itself.</p><p>We envision our customers using this packaging as a stylish and functional element in their homes, aligning with our commitment to eco-friendly practices and thoughtful design.</p>",
